-- =====================================================================
-- Academy pack 1/4: courses, modules, lessons, quizzes, assessments
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Import with Admin > Moderation > Export LD Database > Import row data.
-- One literal INSERT per line, in the Learning export format.
-- Import the four files in order: 1, 2, 3, 4.
--
-- FIXED ID BLOCKS (so the pack loads into a database whose AUTO_INCREMENT
-- values differ from the machine it was built on):
--   courses 900101+   modules 910101+   lessons 920101+   quizzes 930101+
--   assessments 935101+   questions 940101+   options 950101+
--   paths 960101+   path steps 961101+   skills 970101+
--   enrollments 980101+   progress 981101+   grades 985101+
--   certificates 986101+   ratings 987101+   invitations 988101+
--
-- Import each file once: the importer rolls the whole upload back on a
-- duplicate key, so re-running a file fails by design. To start over,
-- remove the pack in phpMyAdmin first (these are the only rows it owns):
--   DELETE FROM ld_quiz_question WHERE id BETWEEN 940101 AND 940999;
--   DELETE FROM ld_course WHERE id BETWEEN 900101 AND 900999;
--   DELETE FROM ld_learning_path WHERE id BETWEEN 960101 AND 960999;
--   DELETE FROM ld_skill WHERE id BETWEEN 970101 AND 970999;
-- Quiz questions have no foreign key to ld_quiz, so deleting the courses
-- alone would leave them behind. Their answer options cascade.

